Scoped Sony Wave64 GUID chunk layout

The GUID constants and the chunk walk, data-size and fact-count semantics in
src/w64.ts follow libavformat/w64.c, wavdec.c (w64_probe, w64_read_header,
find_guid) and wavenc.c (start_guid, end_guid, w64_write_header,
w64_write_trailer).
